==English==
[[File:Clarias batrachus.jpg|thumb|A [[w:walking catfish|walking catfish]]]]
[[File:Platydoras costatus 2 (Piotr Kuczynski).jpg|thumb|A [[w:talking catfish|talking catfish]]]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|En-au-catfish.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{compound|en|cat|fish}}. Likely so named for its prominent [[barbel]]s like a [[cat#English|cat]]'s [[whisker]]s.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|~|catfish|+}}

# Any fish of the order [[Siluriformes]], mainly found in [[freshwater|fresh water]], lacking [[scale]]s, and having [[barbel]]s like [[whisker]]s around the mouth.
#: {{syn|en|catlet|q1=Africa|sheat|sheatfish|river chicken}}
# The meat of such a fish, popular in the Southern U.S. and Central Europe.

